# F1 eval harness firm-workbook derivatives (KTD1/KTD12): confidential law-firm
# taxonomy data. These rules mirror feat/f1-eval-loop so the protection exists on
# main too -- the data sits untracked in this checkout and main previously had no
# rule covering it, so a stray `git add .` here would have committed firm content.
eval/data/*
!eval/data/MANIFEST.md
eval/data/reports/
# Recoverable atomic staging for the committed U10 comparison artifact.
eval/reports/.synthetic-comparison-v1.json.*.tmp
